// Seed construction for the mock store.
//
// Job entries come from src/mock/seed-entries.json — generated by
// tools/gen-seeds.py from the S1 overlay capture (24 held entries)
// + the tracked pair from the contract fixtures, in contract 14's
// target form. Runtime state (runs, dues, pings, ledger) is built
// here relative to the moment the mock server boots, so ages,
// next-due times and 24 h windows are always live-shaped. Outcome
// plans are deterministic cycles per job: the mock engine walks
// them in order, so every surface's behaviour is reproducible.

